VALUES (gen_random_uuid()::text, $q$over-the-top-grapple-runner$q$, $q$Over The Top$q$, $q$A high-octane 2D precision physics runner where players ascend through atmospheric layers using single-button grapple slingshot mechanics. Featuring slow-motion bullet-time aiming, angular aim assist, dynamic hazard fields, and progressive low-gravity physics, every leap demands split-second timing to reach the cosmos. Built in under 48 hours for GIKI SoftCom '26, taking home first place.$q$, $q$Platformer & Arcade$q$, ARRAY[$q$2D$q$, $q$Physics$q$, $q$Platformer$q$, $q$Grapple Mechanics$q$, $q$One-Button$q$, $q$Momentum Runner$q$, $q$Game Jam$q$]::text[], $q$Unity 6, C#, URP 2D, 2D Physics Engine$q$, $q$2025$q$, $q$🪝$q$, $q$#0f766e$q$, true, 4, $q$GAME$q$, $q$HACKATHON$q$, $q$Lead Gameplay Programmer & Systems Designer$q$, $q$Architected the core single-button controller state machine, integrating bullet-time aiming, momentum preservation, and pendulum grapple physics. Developed dynamic environmental obstacle behaviors and custom altitude-driven gravity reduction scaling as the player ascends into orbit. Built an automated in-engine audio manager with dedicated custom editor windows for seamless sound cue integration.$q$, ARRAY[$q$Single-Button Multi-Action Motor: Consolidated auto-running, ground bunny hopping, double-tap direction flipping, hold-to-aim slow-mo, and tether reeling into intuitive single-key inputs.$q$, $q$Bullet-Time Aim Assist: Implemented a 15% time-dilation aiming mode with real-time radial raycasting that dynamically slows rotation when sweeping near valid aerial anchors.$q$, $q$Procedural Trajectory & Tension Rendering: Developed dynamic LineRenderer rope visuals with tension-based color shifting and dot-matrix aim trajectory indicators without sprite dependencies.$q$, $q$Atmospheric Altitude & Gravity Scaling: Engineered an altitude tracking system that systematically decreases gravity above 100m, shifting gameplay from pendulum swinging to low-gravity orbital launches.$q$, $q$Dynamic Hazard & Anchor System: Designed moving airborne platforms including Perlin-noise drifting hot-air balloons, patrolling planes with turbulence simulation, and phased ghost obstacles.$q$, $q$Custom Audio Framework & Inspector Tooling: Built an in-engine SoundManager with custom Unity Editor inspector windows and auto-generated enum sound keys.$q$]::text[], ARRAY[$q$Lead Gameplay & Systems Programmer$q$, $q$UI/UX Artist$q$]::text[], $q$1st Place, Game Development Competition, GIKI SoftCom '26$q$, ARRAY[$q$Single-button momentum-driven grapple and swing mechanics$q$, $q$Bullet-time time dilation with magnetic anchor aim-assist$q$, $q$Optimal release launch window bonuses for high-speed slingshots$q$, $q$Dynamic low-gravity transition above 100m altitude$q$, $q$Moving and phased airborne targets including balloons, kites, and planes$q$, $q$Atmospheric narrative ending sequence with black hole singularity trigger$q$]::text[], ARRAY[$q$Unified State-Machine Motor: Encapsulated complex locomotion states (Running, Aiming, Grappling, Reeling, Releasing, Recovering) in AutoRunnerController to prevent conflicting physics impulses.$q$, $q$Time-Decoupled Aiming: Scaled Time.timeScale to 0.15f during anchor targeting while updating aiming indicators and input sweeps via Time.unscaledDeltaTime for zero input latency.$q$, $q$Centripetal Slingshot Mathematics: Calculated tangential velocities at swing detachment, applying multiplier bonuses when releasing inside optimal green arc angles.$q$, $q$Perlin-Noise Hazard Motion: Utilized 2D Perlin noise and harmonic wave offsets on kites and balloons to simulate organic wind turbulence and floating drift without keyframe overhead.$q$]::text[], $q$PC Standalone, WebGL$q$, false, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
